WEBVTT

00:14.723 --> 00:18.601
It may be possible to attain heaven.

00:18.685 --> 00:21.354
Can you be more specific?

00:21.438 --> 00:24.816
I've recorded it in a notebook.

00:25.400 --> 00:26.234
However,

00:26.317 --> 00:29.028
before I learned of his methods…

00:31.489 --> 00:34.743
I laid in wait for over two decades

00:35.326 --> 00:37.787
to gain access to Jotaro Kujo's memory.

00:38.413 --> 00:41.416
The contents of the notebook
are within his memory.

00:41.499 --> 00:44.794
The murderer had planned to steal
my father's Stand by giving it form.

00:44.878 --> 00:45.837
That's his ability.

00:46.337 --> 00:49.132
My dad's not dead.

00:49.215 --> 00:51.760
If I get his Stand back,
he will come back to life.

00:54.596 --> 00:55.597
I won.

00:55.680 --> 00:58.266
Don't underestimate me, bitch!

00:58.349 --> 01:00.268
Nothing has changed.

01:00.351 --> 01:04.022
Even with Star Platinum,
your father is still a living mummy!

01:04.606 --> 01:07.567
The User has my father's memory disc.

01:07.650 --> 01:10.987
Now's my chance to find its User!

01:15.825 --> 01:19.954
There's something I want you
to try doing to it.

01:20.038 --> 01:23.041
Is that a human bone?

01:23.124 --> 01:24.501
Whose is it?

01:24.584 --> 01:26.753
It doesn't concern you.

01:26.836 --> 01:29.964
Let's just say that it belongs to
an old friend of mine.

01:31.090 --> 01:32.926
My dear friend,

01:33.009 --> 01:34.928
Dio's bone.

03:07.145 --> 03:07.979
EPISODE 13: SMACK OF LOVE AND REVENGE (2)

03:08.062 --> 03:09.898
Damn, it got my leg.

03:09.981 --> 03:12.817
Ermes, just what is happening here?

03:12.901 --> 03:15.528
- Is this a Stand attack?
- That's right.

03:19.073 --> 03:21.409
Run! It's charging towards you!

03:22.285 --> 03:24.162
It's already on the move!

03:24.245 --> 03:25.663
Stone Ocean!

03:36.716 --> 03:37.759
Jolyne!

03:51.231 --> 03:52.982
So this is a Stand ability.

03:53.733 --> 03:57.528
He must have gotten a disc
from Pale Snake.

03:58.029 --> 03:59.280
This must mean…

04:00.114 --> 04:01.491
I see now.

04:01.574 --> 04:04.285
Jolyne, take F.F. and get out of here.

04:04.869 --> 04:06.704
This is my problem.

04:06.788 --> 04:08.706
You stay out of it.

04:09.290 --> 04:10.792
No, Ermes.

04:10.875 --> 04:13.336
This isn't just your problem anymore.

04:14.796 --> 04:17.173
Sports Maximum must be after something.

04:17.882 --> 04:21.803
Most likely, it's related to
my father's stolen memory.

04:21.886 --> 04:25.223
He is trying to find something
within these prison walls.

04:25.848 --> 04:28.393
And we can learn what he's plotting

04:28.476 --> 04:31.729
by reading the disc
inside Sports Maximum's head.

04:31.813 --> 04:35.566
Jolyne, focus on
escaping this corridor for now.

04:36.150 --> 04:39.779
He has got to be close
to drowning in that pipe.

04:39.862 --> 04:42.782
If we can hold out until then,
his ability will disappear.

04:43.700 --> 04:45.243
- Something's off.
- What?

04:45.827 --> 04:46.828
Where is it?

04:46.911 --> 04:49.205
The invisible stuffed alligator.

04:50.665 --> 04:52.458
If it moves, the threads should vibrate

04:52.542 --> 04:54.210
and show me its location.

05:03.511 --> 05:04.846
It's on the wall!

05:05.430 --> 05:07.265
The hell?

05:07.348 --> 05:10.935
Shit, an invisible corpse
has no concept of up and down.

05:11.019 --> 05:13.062
It can travel on the floor or the walls!

05:13.730 --> 05:15.481
Stop!

05:15.565 --> 05:18.693
I'm the one you want, bastard!

05:18.776 --> 05:20.361
You're wrong, Ermes.

05:20.445 --> 05:22.780
He's no longer just an enemy of you two.

05:23.364 --> 05:26.951
This bastard bit off my left leg.

05:27.869 --> 05:29.454
Where is my leg now?

05:29.537 --> 05:30.913
In its stomach?

05:31.581 --> 05:33.750
So this asshole is my enemy too.

05:35.084 --> 05:36.669
Stay back, F.F.

05:36.753 --> 05:38.254
We don't know where it is.

05:38.838 --> 05:40.048
It'll take a bite out of you!

05:41.299 --> 05:43.426
Stop, F.F.

05:45.720 --> 05:47.096
You're right.

05:47.180 --> 05:48.681
It'll bite me.

05:48.765 --> 05:51.768
That's all these corpses can do.

05:51.851 --> 05:53.770
But it's fine.

05:53.853 --> 05:56.689
I got my hand inside its mouth.

06:06.074 --> 06:07.617
We did it.

06:08.117 --> 06:10.411
I felt it going down.

06:16.751 --> 06:19.587
Isn't this a part of your mauled shoulder?

06:20.505 --> 06:23.299
Dammit, it may not be big enough
to patch up.

06:23.841 --> 06:25.802
He chomped your shoulder to pieces.

06:25.885 --> 06:27.553
Here, F.F.

06:27.637 --> 06:29.680
Oh, thanks.

06:29.764 --> 06:33.059
- Ermes, come closer.
- Yeah?

06:42.360 --> 06:44.529
Ermes, am I correct

06:44.612 --> 06:48.366
that we were attacked by
an alligator-like ghost?

06:48.950 --> 06:51.786
Sports Maximum controls these ghosts.

06:51.869 --> 06:53.746
No, I don't think that's right.

06:54.330 --> 06:55.498
It was way too vicious.

06:55.581 --> 06:58.793
It wasn't a ghost,
but an invisible corpse.

06:58.876 --> 06:59.919
What?

07:00.837 --> 07:04.423
A living dead that hunts for blood
by instinct.

07:04.507 --> 07:08.094
Sports Maximum's ability
can create invisible zombies.

07:09.303 --> 07:10.680
The pipe!

07:11.639 --> 07:13.141
What is it now, Ermes?

07:13.683 --> 07:15.435
What happened to Sports Maximum?

07:15.518 --> 07:17.228
Did he drown to death?

07:17.812 --> 07:18.980
I can't tell.

07:19.063 --> 07:20.606
It's too dark for me to see.

07:20.690 --> 07:23.025
He may be lodged deeper in the pipe.

07:23.818 --> 07:24.652
Or, maybe he…

07:25.862 --> 07:28.239
These handprints…

07:36.622 --> 07:38.458
Fuck…

07:39.083 --> 07:41.752
My throat is coated with shitty water.

07:42.670 --> 07:44.422
I want to rinse my mouth, dammit.

07:44.505 --> 07:47.425
What was I about to do?

07:47.508 --> 07:49.802
Where was I trying to go?

07:50.803 --> 07:53.264
Oh, I remember it now.

07:53.347 --> 07:54.640
The chapel…

07:55.224 --> 07:56.726
I'm headed to the chapel.

07:58.436 --> 08:00.313
My mission…

08:00.396 --> 08:03.065
is to find that piece of bone.

08:03.649 --> 08:06.944
If you fail, surely you understand

08:07.028 --> 08:11.157
that the ability I bestowed
will no longer be yours.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.366
I know it.

08:12.450 --> 08:16.454
My ability, Limp Viscuit,
can find that bone.

08:16.537 --> 08:19.665
The bone Pale Snake ordered me to find.

08:20.166 --> 08:21.751
I can find it.

08:22.502 --> 08:24.295
Dammit.

08:24.378 --> 08:27.215
I sure could use a break before I start.

08:27.882 --> 08:31.385
Like a good scrubbing
and something to drink.

08:31.469 --> 08:33.804
Something refreshing.

08:37.642 --> 08:39.393
That woman there…

08:39.477 --> 08:40.895
Perfect timing.

08:40.978 --> 08:45.024
She's a bitch type… What was her name?

08:45.107 --> 08:46.817
I can't recall it.

08:47.318 --> 08:48.611
I'll just call her a bitch.

08:52.281 --> 08:53.324
Damn.

08:53.407 --> 08:56.494
Won't even greet me
though I'm bribing him.

08:57.453 --> 08:59.997
Hey, how's it going?

09:00.081 --> 09:01.332
Are you on duty?

09:01.916 --> 09:04.252
I could use a drink.

09:04.335 --> 09:06.420
You want to go to the cafe with me?

09:06.504 --> 09:11.300
Afterward, we can have a little fun
in a corner in some room.

09:11.884 --> 09:14.637
We can rub each other's bodies all over.

09:18.307 --> 09:22.186
Asshole, how dare you touch me?

09:22.270 --> 09:25.648
You touched me. You better pay up first!

09:25.731 --> 09:27.441
What are you talking about?

09:27.525 --> 09:28.901
Little shit.

09:28.985 --> 09:32.154
How dare he touch you
when he hasn't even paid?

09:36.659 --> 09:37.743
What the…

09:38.494 --> 09:39.328
Dammit.

09:39.912 --> 09:41.831
Where did Sports Maximum go off to?

09:42.957 --> 09:47.628
He must have escaped that pipe
while we were dealing with the alligator.

09:48.254 --> 09:49.338
Or…

09:49.422 --> 09:53.050
Maybe he has already
turned into an invisible corpse.

09:53.634 --> 09:55.803
That was just a little kick.

09:55.886 --> 09:57.805
Stop fooling around!

09:57.888 --> 09:59.599
Fooling around?

09:59.682 --> 10:02.310
He looks down on you once
and it's over for you, bitch.

10:02.393 --> 10:05.021
Do whatever it takes to make him pay up.

10:05.104 --> 10:07.231
Lend me a hand, and let's find his cash.

10:08.858 --> 10:11.277
Are you listening? Come on, help me.

10:12.320 --> 10:14.196
He's got something on his sleeves.

10:14.280 --> 10:15.364
What's this?

10:16.324 --> 10:19.035
Oh, so you will pay me?

10:19.118 --> 10:21.162
Why didn't you say that first?

10:21.245 --> 10:24.957
That's what I just said.
Listen closely, idiot.

10:26.250 --> 10:31.255
What else can he be hiding?
What about here inside his mouth?

10:33.758 --> 10:37.720
Hold on, you want to do it
right now, right here?

10:37.803 --> 10:39.347
I don't get it.

10:39.430 --> 10:41.307
What is it that you want to do?

10:41.390 --> 10:44.852
Come on, stop fooling around.

10:44.935 --> 10:48.272
I don't do that kinky stuff.

10:52.985 --> 10:56.864
I'll be taking this.
You had something nice, after all.

11:06.415 --> 11:08.417
What the hell is this?

11:08.501 --> 11:09.543
This isn't a drug.

11:09.627 --> 11:11.629
It's seeping out of my skin.

11:12.922 --> 11:14.548
This smell…

11:14.632 --> 11:15.800
It's sewage!

11:15.883 --> 11:17.301
It's the stench of sewage!

11:19.428 --> 11:20.930
My body…

11:21.013 --> 11:24.475
The filthy water seeping out of
my body reeks of…

11:25.059 --> 11:28.062
Fuck! No, I can't already be…

11:28.145 --> 11:29.355
The hell?

11:29.438 --> 11:32.191
It's flowing from midair.
The fuck's going on?

11:46.789 --> 11:50.543
I didn't want anything to drink
in the first place.

11:50.626 --> 11:52.086
I wanted to devour something!

11:52.670 --> 11:55.923
I wanted to devour
and satisfy this craving!

11:56.006 --> 11:57.258
Yes, the brains!

11:58.259 --> 12:00.136
I remember it now.

12:00.219 --> 12:03.556
I drowned to death in that pipe.

12:04.140 --> 12:06.350
Shit! She did this to me!

12:06.934 --> 12:09.770
That younger sister of Gloria Costello!

12:10.354 --> 12:13.149
That bitch, how dare she do this to me?

12:14.608 --> 12:16.235
How dare she!

12:20.781 --> 12:22.074
I thirst!

12:27.288 --> 12:28.706
Ermes, look over there.

12:28.789 --> 12:29.832
Oh, my.

12:32.168 --> 12:34.879
Be careful. He's out of the pipe
just as I thought.

12:34.962 --> 12:36.547
How did he do this to her?

12:36.630 --> 12:39.049
Did he bite her to death?

12:39.633 --> 12:41.719
Are human teeth capable
of such a vicious attack?

12:41.802 --> 12:44.013
Can they destroy a human body like this?

12:44.096 --> 12:48.476
He's no longer human,
neither in intelligence nor morals.

12:48.559 --> 12:52.521
But Pale Snake's disc is
with this man, without a doubt.

12:52.605 --> 12:54.982
I'll do whatever it takes
to get that disc.

12:55.065 --> 12:57.693
Jolyne, you wait outside.

13:02.990 --> 13:05.409
Damn, he slipped out.

13:06.452 --> 13:07.786
Don't leave my side, Ermes.

13:08.412 --> 13:09.455
We're trapped in!

13:10.080 --> 13:12.166
He is capable of thinking
just like a human!

13:12.750 --> 13:14.168
Stay away from the wall!

13:14.251 --> 13:17.796
We already know that
he's not confined to the floor!

13:18.380 --> 13:20.633
We'll track his location
three-dimensionally!

13:22.718 --> 13:24.094
There you are!

13:26.180 --> 13:28.390
You chose to hang from the ceiling.

13:28.974 --> 13:30.976
Sounds like I crushed some bones.

13:35.189 --> 13:39.527
Grabbing with his broken wrist?
Right, he's already a corpse.

13:41.445 --> 13:42.613
Stone Ocean!

13:45.658 --> 13:46.492
He's caught!

13:51.288 --> 13:52.289
No.

13:52.873 --> 13:53.832
Jolyne!

13:53.916 --> 13:55.918
That's not Sports Maximum!

13:56.502 --> 13:59.713
He's using
the dead woman's body as a decoy!

14:02.091 --> 14:04.385
Jolyne!

14:09.056 --> 14:10.975
STAND NAME: LIMP VISCUIT
STAND MASTER: SPORTS MAXIMUM

14:12.518 --> 14:14.019
Jolyne!

14:19.692 --> 14:22.403
Where? Where the hell are you, fucker?

14:24.280 --> 14:25.656
Jolyne.

14:25.739 --> 14:28.117
Don't move anymore, Jolyne.

14:28.200 --> 14:30.703
He's not your enemy.

14:30.786 --> 14:33.372
This is between me and Sports Maximum.

14:33.455 --> 14:35.374
Like I said, Ermes.

14:35.457 --> 14:36.876
This goes beyond

14:36.959 --> 14:41.297
your personal desire for revenge.

14:42.840 --> 14:45.342
No, not even beyond.

14:45.426 --> 14:49.555
We are already out of time
and energy to even plan.

14:49.638 --> 14:50.472
Look over there.

14:54.852 --> 14:56.478
- He can't be…
- He's had us…

14:57.938 --> 15:01.942
cornered the entire time.

15:02.776 --> 15:04.904
He has already revived them.

15:04.987 --> 15:06.906
The invisible undead.

15:08.407 --> 15:10.200
Who knows how many are lurking and where.

15:10.284 --> 15:12.536
We're surrounded, Ermes.

15:12.620 --> 15:14.872
Let's turn back for now.

15:14.955 --> 15:16.874
Staying alive is our priority.

15:16.957 --> 15:20.294
We must open that door
so that we can escape.

15:20.377 --> 15:23.547
I'll extend the thread
as much as possible to get F.F.

15:23.631 --> 15:24.798
We'll retreat for now.

15:24.882 --> 15:26.258
Retrieving the disc

15:26.842 --> 15:28.469
and getting your revenge can wait.

15:32.890 --> 15:33.891
Ermes!

15:34.558 --> 15:35.643
Revenge…

15:36.185 --> 15:39.480
That's what's important here, Jolyne.

15:40.481 --> 15:43.734
Revenge matters most
even to Sports Maximum,

15:43.817 --> 15:45.861
who is lurking somewhere in this room.

15:46.445 --> 15:49.657
He wants to get revenge for
being drowned to death.

15:50.157 --> 15:53.202
He must be overcome by
vengeance right now.

15:53.744 --> 15:59.083
He wants to maul me to death
and fill his mouth with blood.

15:59.166 --> 16:03.170
- What are you--
- Sports Maximum will make sure

16:03.253 --> 16:05.923
- that he's the one who kills me.
- Ermes.

16:06.590 --> 16:07.967
Listen, Jolyne.

16:08.050 --> 16:12.304
Some people will say getting even
won't bring my sister back.

16:12.388 --> 16:14.974
As if they know what I went through.

16:15.057 --> 16:17.643
And others tell me
forgiveness is important.

16:18.310 --> 16:20.521
Gloria!

16:21.105 --> 16:21.981
Bullshit.

16:22.564 --> 16:25.275
Forcing myself to forget how it feels

16:25.359 --> 16:28.821
to have family thrown
in the gutter and live on?

16:28.904 --> 16:30.948
I refuse to live like that,

16:31.824 --> 16:34.660
and I've braced myself for this moment.

16:35.536 --> 16:41.000
Revenge is the way
to settle the score with my fate.

16:41.959 --> 16:43.460
No, Ermes.

16:43.544 --> 16:45.170
Fighting him to the death?

16:45.254 --> 16:47.464
Stop. Step back, Ermes.

16:47.548 --> 16:49.383
I'm reaching F.F. at this very moment.

16:49.466 --> 16:51.844
Five, no, seven of the undead

16:51.927 --> 16:54.388
are severing my threads
and closing in on us!

16:55.681 --> 16:59.059
Don't do this, Ermes!

17:03.230 --> 17:05.357
Ermes!

17:06.358 --> 17:09.278
Which direction would he strike from?

17:12.823 --> 17:15.451
My… consciousness…

17:21.749 --> 17:23.083
Ermes…

17:25.461 --> 17:28.130
She copied her head with her sticker!

17:28.213 --> 17:29.339
The seal of kiss…

17:29.423 --> 17:31.341
is my license for revenge!

17:31.425 --> 17:35.054
I found you, Sports Maximum!

17:37.890 --> 17:41.101
I knew you'd try as much.

17:41.185 --> 17:44.313
Just like when you trapped me
in that pipe,

17:44.396 --> 17:49.526
I knew you'd use that sticker
to copy an object.

17:49.610 --> 17:52.362
Your ability won't work against
me anymore.

17:52.446 --> 17:54.615
After all, I am…

17:54.698 --> 17:57.701
already dead.

17:57.785 --> 18:00.245
Shit, it didn't work.

18:00.329 --> 18:01.538
Where the hell is he?

18:01.622 --> 18:04.917
You can't hear my voice, can you?

18:05.000 --> 18:06.752
But I'll say it anyway.

18:06.835 --> 18:12.382
It's your sister's fault
for witnessing what she shouldn't have.

18:14.259 --> 18:16.136
Er… mes…

18:23.268 --> 18:24.686
Damn! Missed again!

18:24.770 --> 18:26.355
Because of your sister,

18:26.438 --> 18:30.275
I fell into your hands,
and look at me now.

18:30.359 --> 18:33.529
I will never get over this feeling.

18:33.612 --> 18:34.738
Not this one.

18:34.822 --> 18:35.989
Nor this one.

18:36.073 --> 18:37.324
Listen up.

18:37.407 --> 18:41.120
Even if I eat your brains

18:41.203 --> 18:47.459
and stuff the shit in your guts
into your emptied skull,

18:47.543 --> 18:50.629
I will never get over what you did to me.

18:54.424 --> 18:55.551
It's over!

18:55.634 --> 18:58.929
Now, I will finish you off!

19:02.558 --> 19:05.853
Ermes was waiting for this exact moment!

19:05.936 --> 19:10.357
The moment he removes the sticker
so he can maul her head!

19:10.440 --> 19:12.025
Remove the sticker,

19:12.109 --> 19:14.027
and the copy fuses back to the original.

19:14.111 --> 19:18.157
Even if Sports Maximum
had swallowed the duplicate earlier!

19:18.240 --> 19:21.451
I know exactly where you are now!

19:21.535 --> 19:23.370
Aim slightly above.

19:23.453 --> 19:26.832
The midsagittal plane of your face!

19:36.049 --> 19:37.134
She got him!

19:37.217 --> 19:38.719
Listen.

19:38.802 --> 19:41.388
This kick is for Gloria.

19:41.471 --> 19:44.558
Sounds like the bones on your face
broke just now.

19:44.641 --> 19:47.644
Think of it as Gloria smashing your face.

19:48.228 --> 19:49.438
And this…

19:49.521 --> 19:51.148
is also for Gloria!

19:52.733 --> 19:55.319
Make mincemeat out of this bitch!

19:58.405 --> 20:00.908
You plan on hiding again.

20:00.991 --> 20:02.743
Well, you won't be able to.

20:02.826 --> 20:06.538
A sticker split your head in two.

20:07.664 --> 20:10.542
Remove this sticker,
and it returns to the original.

20:11.543 --> 20:14.588
The next hit is also for Gloria.

20:17.132 --> 20:18.884
And the one after that too.

20:20.761 --> 20:23.138
And so is the next one!

20:23.222 --> 20:25.599
The next one too.

20:25.682 --> 20:27.059
They are all for Gloria!

20:27.142 --> 20:28.518
This one,

20:29.269 --> 20:30.562
and this one too!

20:31.480 --> 20:32.481
Take this!

20:33.482 --> 20:35.192
And this!

20:35.275 --> 20:37.361
This, this, and this!

20:37.444 --> 20:39.404
This, this, this, and this!

20:39.488 --> 20:42.616
They're all for Gloria!

21:11.144 --> 21:15.565
I don't know why,
but tears started rolling down.

21:17.025 --> 21:22.281
I just want… to cry next to you.

21:23.699 --> 21:29.162
But I may not have that kind of time.

21:31.790 --> 21:33.166
F.F.!

21:33.250 --> 21:35.502
Where are you? Come heal her!

21:35.585 --> 21:37.504
Hurry!

21:37.587 --> 21:39.256
Open this door.

21:39.339 --> 21:40.841
Hurry!

21:40.924 --> 21:43.010
SPORTS MAXIMUM
STAND NAME: LIMP VISCUIT - ANNIHILATED

23:14.267 --> 23:15.977
Emergency alarm,

23:16.061 --> 23:18.480
Commons Area 1A, Mausoleum.

23:18.563 --> 23:19.940
Stop right there!

23:20.023 --> 23:21.024
What's going on here?

23:21.108 --> 23:22.901
Don't move!

